// Processes WorkcenterHistory events and updates OeeHourly records
// - Validates data integrity (prevents exceeding hour duration)
// - Handles NO-SCHEDULE mode with scheduleId validation
// - Classifies time according to mode (run/setup/downtime/planned downtime)
// - Calculates ISO 22400 availability percentage
// - Returns pure milliseconds (no ISO duration strings)
